    Corner Glenfield Road & Downing Street, Glenfield
    Store centre: -36.788269, 174.709416

    WHAT THIS TESTS: the clean baseline. Glenfield has no other monitored store
    within its 800 m radius, so exactly one didEnterRegion should fire and
    exactly one Live Activity should start, named "Countdown Glenfield".
    If THIS route is flaky, the problem is in the region/APNs pipeline itself,
    not in overlap handling.

    The crossing happens between waypoints 3 and 4 (870 m -> 650 m).

    USE: Xcode, Debug, Simulate Location, CountdownGlenfield-Approach
-->
